-fmacro-prefix-map=<old>=<new>, backported from upstream clang (D49466; GCC 8
has the same option). Valve's retail modules embed __FILE__ as Xcode passed
it, an absolute buildbot path (/Users/buildbot/buildslave/rel_singleplayer_osx/
build/src/public/tier1/utlvector.h); waf passes paths relative to the build
directory. When several prefixes match, the last one on the command line wins
(GCC's rule, and upstream clang's since 2022). Preprocessor only: without the
option, objects are byte-identical to the unpatched compiler's.
Applies to clang-600.0.5x and clang-503.0.38.

